    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've tried the professionals too. it's all just more talking. it doesn't change the fact that everything is finished. he's gone, and i have nothing left to give. i look at the bed every night and i just think about how peaceful it would be to just go to sleep and never have to face tomorrow again. it seems like the only way to actually find some quiet.",
